# Base URL of the FastAPI backend (backend/app.py).
#
# Leave this UNSET (or delete the line) for local dev: the frontend will
# then call relative "/api/..." paths, which the Vite dev server proxies
# to http://localhost:8000 automatically (see vite.config.ts). This is the
# recommended default and requires no .env file at all.
#
# Only set this if your backend runs on a different host/port with no
# proxy in front of it. Prefer an explicit IP over "localhost" (some
# environments resolve "localhost" to ::1 first and fail to connect even
# when the backend is listening on 127.0.0.1):
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
